  "id": "euthanasia",
  "term": "euthanasia",
  "definition": "In psychiatry-related discussion, euthanasia is the ending of a person’s life because of suffering and is often considered together with assisted suicide. For people with mental disorders, it is viewed as a complex clinical, ethical, and legal issue because psychiatric suffering can vary with context and time, making its seriousness and possible reversibility harder to assess.",
